```
`OwnerCustomerCodeDeduplicator.unique()` (`.../OwnerCustomerCodeDeduplicator.java:40-50`) appends `-<n>` (n>=2) on collision, so the stored code is normally `NSW26A1B2C3D4`, or `NSW26A1B2C3D4-2` on collision.

### householdId — `OwnerIdentityKey.householdId()`
`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/advice/OwnerIdentityKey.java`
```java
